    <li>All prices are <strong>split- and dividend-adjusted</strong>, sourced from the Kaggle dataset "American Express (AXP) Stock Data (1972–2026)".</li>
    <li><strong>CAGR</strong> is computed as (End Price / Start Price)<sup>1/Years</sup> &minus; 1.</li>
