    <li><strong>Cumulative Total Return</strong> reflects price appreciation only; it does not include dividend reinvestment.</li>
    <li>Early-period data (1970s) has zero volume and identical OHLC values; these records are excluded from volatility calculations but included in price trend analysis.</li>
    <li>Dividend yield is approximated as annual dividends per share divided by the average closing price for that year.</li>
